{"id":"ayant","lemma":"ayant","pos":"noun","rank":1503,"glosses":["haver, holder"],"ipa":"/ɛ.jɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-ayant.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-ayant.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ayants"},"examples":[{"text":"Venez, s'il vous plaît, en ayant faim.","en":"Please come hungry.","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to please","l":"plaire"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"hunger"}]},{"text":"Nous sommes allés nous coucher en ayant faim.","en":"We went to bed hungry.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to lay, to lay down"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"hunger"}]},{"text":"J'aime les histoires ayant une fin triste.","en":"I like stories that have sad endings.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"a scene, drama"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"end, close, finish"},{"g":"sad"}]},{"text":"Connaissez-vous quelqu'un ayant besoin d'un emploi ?","en":"Do you know anyone who needs a job?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"job"}]},{"text":"Ayant fait son travail, elle n'a plus rien à faire.","en":"Having done the work, she has nothing to do.","words":[null,{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"work"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[8,11,"I don't care"]]}]}